{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1391730-religious-beast-begotten-worship-of-the-dark-mother","id":1391730,"title":"Religious Beast; Begotten Worship of the Dark Mother","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-26T11:33:54-07:00","id":1391730,"title":"Religious Beast; Begotten Worship of the Dark Mother","content":"Just hear me out please; so, I was listening to the quotes of Illaoi in her part of the LoL Wiki (because 1. I don't have the game, 2. I like listening to them and 3. why the heck not?) and I thought to myself &quot;[TerrorCooper], you mad bugger, these lines seem akin to what might be said by a Begotten who worships the Dark Mother as a Deity/Goddess. What say you to us sharing this with our fellow fans of the gameline?&quot; My response was a simple &quot;Then what the hell are we waiting for?&quot; and I hauled ass over to here to share this revelation. Anyways, in essence here's what I'm thinking; how would each of you play/run (depending on if you were a player or StoryTeller respectively) such a character? A casual worshipper (think the average Christian, Muslim, Buddhist, etc on the street) who hasen't developed their beliefs all that much beyond what the Children usually say about the DM? A Zelous/Fanatical Fanatic/Zealot with a complex belief system? Somewhere in between? And do they have followers, be thay fellow Beasts of a similar(-ish) mindset, Cultists inducted in by some Rite of Passage, or some combination thereof? <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'd like to note that the only views I hold towards religion that are even vaguely negative is towards those of cloth who would try and twist, warp, and otherwise distort their religion's/belief system's teachings to justify things like abuse, torture, rape, murder and other such atrocities when said teachings actually discourage it.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T12:40:09-07:00","id":1391750,"title":"","content":"A Beast's relationship with the Dark Mother runs the gamut of religiosity from apathy towards her to utter devotion transformed into building a full on cult to her (fortunately the Beast Players Guide has us covered for ways to implement things for more devoted Beasts).<br /> <br /> As a player, I'd do whatever felt right for the character (currently: doesn't give a shit about the Dark Mother as deity, only as a story to explain the way of the world).<br /> <br /> As a ST, I'd generally try to represent the range of possibilities as suits the needs of the story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T20:14:53-07:00","id":1392736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1391730-religious-beast-begotten-worship-of-the-dark-mother#post1391730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just hear me out please; so, I was listening to the quotes of Illaoi in her part of the LoL Wiki (because 1. I don't have the game, 2. I like listening to them and 3. why the heck not?) and I thought to myself &quot;[TerrorCooper], you mad bugger, these lines seem akin to what might be said by a Begotten who worships the Dark Mother as a Deity/Goddess. What say you to us sharing this with our fellow fans of the gameline?&quot; My response was a simple &quot;Then what the hell are we waiting for?&quot; and I hauled ass over to here to share this revelation. Anyways, in essence here's what I'm thinking; how would each of you play/run (depending on if you were a player or StoryTeller respectively) such a character? A casual worshipper (think the average Christian, Muslim, Buddhist, etc on the street) who hasen't developed their beliefs all that much beyond what the Children usually say about the DM? A Zelous/Fanatical Fanatic/Zealot with a complex belief system? Somewhere in between? And do they have followers, be thay fellow Beasts of a similar(-ish) mindset, Cultists inducted in by some Rite of Passage, or some combination thereof? <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'd like to note that the only views I hold towards religion that are even vaguely negative is towards those of cloth who would try and twist, warp, and otherwise distort their religion's/belief system's teachings to justify things like abuse, torture, rape, murder and other such atrocities when said teachings actually discourage it.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've had Beast characters who run the gamut from 'doesn't care' to 'fanatical worshipper' and everything in-between. All are fun, all work. I have yet to do the 'deluded, hypocritical priest' type, though. Could be fun to try out on an antagonist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-30T08:17:52-07:00","id":1392810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eternal Darkness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1391730-religious-beast-begotten-worship-of-the-dark-mother?p=1392736#post1392736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've had Beast characters who run the gamut from 'doesn't care' to 'fanatical worshipper' and everything in-between. All are fun, all work. I have yet to do the 'deluded, hypocritical priest' type, though. Could be fun to try out on an antagonist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Care to gift us with a couple of quotes said by the Begotten of a more theological bent? I\u2019ve got an idea for a B:TP character who\u2019s similar to Illaoi of LoL, but I\u2019ve yet to fully coalesce their personality, at least mentally, and I feel the quotes might give me, and others, some inspiration.<br /> <br /> Also, that priest comment indicates that you\u2019ve run (or at least encountered) priests who were either delusional or hypocritical, but not both.<br /> <br /> And one last thing; if anyone wants to share particularly awesome, badass, hilarious, stupid and/or otherwise interesting stories involving Beasts with a theistic view and approach towards the Dark Mother, then do so by all means.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-30T18:31:00-07:00","id":1392967,"title":"","content":"&quot;Some people don't have in themselves to do the right thing, what is necessary, to grow and change. Fortunately, Mother knows how to motivate them.&quot;<br /> Unfamiliar with LoL but I did have a subtle worshipper of the Dark Mother as a character. Took awhile for people to twig that she wasn't talking about herself...around the time they had to help with a sacrificial Rite.<br /> <br /> &quot;Mother always knows.&quot;<br /> &quot;All motivation begins as fear. Fear of loss, of weakness, of death, of being unworthy...you aren't unloved child, Mother will always love you. She's just disappointed you aren't trying to be more.&quot;<br /> &quot;There is a reason to be afraid. Mother made sure of that.&quot;<br /> &quot;Choices are important, you can't put them off forever. Mother won't let you.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother has you.&quot;<br /> &quot;Be a good boy for Mother dear, and remind them of the truth they are trying to forget.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother won't save you dearie, she wants you to do it yourself.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother knows you're sacred little one. It makes her happy.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother isn't angry...just disappointed.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother doesn't love you because you are strong. She just can't forgive weakness.&quot;<br /> <br /> That last one I thought would give the game away, but nope.<br /> <br /> &quot;This will end in blood. Either way, Mother will be pleased.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T06:45:32-07:00","id":1393074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1391730-religious-beast-begotten-worship-of-the-dark-mother?p=1392967#post1392967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Some people don't have in themselves to do the right thing, what is necessary, to grow and change. Fortunately, Mother knows how to motivate them.&quot;<br /> Unfamiliar with LoL but I did have a subtle worshipper of the Dark Mother as a character. Took awhile for people to twig that she wasn't talking about herself...around the time they had to help with a sacrificial Rite.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> LoL is a MOBA game set in the world of Runeterra. One of Its main sticking points is the sheer number of Champions (playable characters) and their variety, meaning theres always something for you. And I'm guessing that the rest of the Brood/Toupe had <i>quite</i> the WTF?! moment when they realised what your character was talking about.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1391730-religious-beast-begotten-worship-of-the-dark-mother?p=1392967#post1392967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Mother always knows.&quot;<br /> &quot;All motivation begins as fear. Fear of loss, of weakness, of death, of being unworthy...you aren't unloved child, Mother will always love you. She's just disappointed you aren't trying to be more.&quot;<br /> &quot;There is a reason to be afraid. Mother made sure of that.&quot;<br /> &quot;Choices are important, you can't put them off forever. Mother won't let you.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother has you.&quot;<br /> &quot;Be a good boy for Mother dear, and remind them of the truth they are trying to forget.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother won't save you dearie, she wants you to do it yourself.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother knows you're sacred little one. It makes her happy.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother isn't angry...just disappointed.&quot;<br /> &quot;Mother doesn't love you because you are strong. She just can't forgive weakness.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ooohoohohooh, these gave me <i>chills</i>! They sound <i>just</i> like Illaoi in my head!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1391730-religious-beast-begotten-worship-of-the-dark-mother?p=1392967#post1392967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That last one I thought would give the game away, but nope.<br /> <br /> &quot;This will end in blood. Either way, Mother will be pleased.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I'd have <i>definitely</i> gotten clued in that your character wasn't speaking of herself. Or at least that <i>something</i> was up. And that last quote is <u><i><b>AWESOME</b></i></u>!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-01T06:19:40-07:00","id":1393404,"title":"","content":"I take most of inspirations for religious Beasts from new <b>Chilling Adventures of Sabrina</b> - this Netflix series is about witches coven worshiping Satan as Father Figure and the leader of fear. Just change it to mother figure in your mind and you have dozens of inspirations for Dark Mother worship and Begotten society! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> We have whole topic on interpretation of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1263200-chilling-adventures-of-sabrina-as-beast-chronicle\"><b>CAoS</b> as Beast chronicle</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> / Small spoiler - Later, coven turns even to direct worship of Hecate, that is one of tittles for Dark Mother. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> /","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}